# ─── CMS runtime data — never commit ────────────────────────────────────
# content/ is the writable runtime store. It is mutated on every admin edit
# and it accumulates guest personal data (inquiry names, emails, phone
# numbers, review authors), so the whole directory stays out of git.
#
# A fresh clone/deploy initialises itself from the tracked editorial snapshot
# in seed/db.seed.json (refresh it with `npm run seed:snapshot`), falling back
# to the compiled content layer in src/data.
content/
